<title>JAPAN: TABLE - Japan June revised industry output down 3.2%.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Japan June revised industry output down 3.2%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production in June fell a revised 3.2 percent from the previous month, compared with a preliminary estimate of a 3.1 percent fall, the Trade Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>On a year-on-year basis, industrial production rose a revised 7.9 percent, against a preliminary estimate of an 8.0 percent increase.</p>
